  lines:
  - english: Some words are coming back. Your letter fragments seem to help.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t v\xE0i t\u1EEB \u0111ang hi\u1EC7n l\u1EA1i. Nh\u1EEFng
      m\u1EA3nh ch\u1EEF c\u1EADu t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF3 v\u1EBB \u0111ang
      gi\xFAp \xEDch."
  - english: One step at a time. We can get through this.
    vietnamese: "'One step at a time' \u2014 c\u1EE9 t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1ED9t.
      Ch\xFAng ta s\u1EBD v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y."
